{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the mystical secrets of the deep with new content!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What's inside?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Zombiefish Pet</strong> \u2013 an ancient undead fish whose magical shell increases protection against the undead by 5%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629240/extras/_zombie614.jpg?t=1744178717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fisher-Hunter Background</strong> \u2013  a rare customization item that replaces the current character window background and is added to your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629240/extras/_background614.jpg?t=1744178717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mimicking Modifier x10</strong> \u2013 change the appearance of your equipment into a random item of the same category!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629240/extras/_mimic614.jpg?t=1744178717\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to claim?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at level 3</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automatically sent to in-game mail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works for any number of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your pet in the Journal once the item has been activated</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629240?t=1744178717","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629240?t=1744178717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629240/8f14f3797250e0fd9113023ffdb397af37b6b327/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744178717","capsule_imagev